<title>TURKEY: TURK TUPRAS BUYS 30,000 T GASOLINE FROM GLENCORE.</title>
<headline>TURK TUPRAS BUYS 30,000 T GASOLINE FROM GLENCORE.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's state oil refinery Tupras said on Thursday it had bought 30,000 tonnes of gasoline from Glencore at a discount of $6.08 per tonne CFR for August 14-16 delivery to Izmir port.</p>
<p>The price is based off Italy Mediterranean quotations.</p>
<p>The tender was issued on July 29.</p>
<p>--Ankara newsroom, 90-312-4462940</p>
